ard option under the Manage Card tab.\n- Select the Last Statement category to view a recent Credit Card statement.\n- View your transactions of the last 30 days under Past Statement.\n- Click on Debit Card to view your virtual CVV.\n- View Demat account summary Click on Invest and Insure.\n- Select All Relationship - Demat Account.\n- Track cheques by clicking on Services, then Cheque book services and select Check Status of the Cheques issued.\n- Stop a Cheque by clicking Cheque book services and Stop Cheque.\n- Get the summary of your loans under the Summary tab.\n- Get a detailed statement of your loans under the Transaction tab.\n- Download your EMI schedule by clicking on Loans, selecting More Options and clicking on EMI Schedule.\n- Get your Loan Statement e-mailed by selecting More options followed by EMI Schedule.\n\nSubscribe to the ICICI Bank YouTube Channel and remember to press the bell icon to get notifications on our latest products and services offerings. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/icicibank/videos?sub_confirmation=1\n\nThere is more than one way to connect with us, so be sure to check our ICICI Bank at:\nWebsite: https://www.icicibank.com\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/icicibank\nLinkedIn: https://in.linkedin.com/company/icici-bank\"", "channel_id": "UCDsxd7FVqC4n9AiggDXHUqQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDsxd7FVqC4n9AiggDXHUqQ", "duration": 198, "view_count": 4123, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JuIhGdWmcJk", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": ["financial services", "non financial services"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "chapters": [{"start_time": 0, "end_time": 45.0, "title": "<Untitled Chapter 1>"}, {"start_time": 45.0, "title": "Change Login PIN, Finger Print, Refer a